Author: jayteealao <jayteealao@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Sep 22 19:49:11 2026 +0100

    fix(football-manager-match-engine): verify-time fixes for viewer-pitch
    
    A speed the panel can show at one tick per frame never skips a tick. A
    stalled frame lands on the next tick instead, so playback runs slightly
    late. At 1x a slow first frame no longer passes over ticks while the
    stream burst decodes.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

